{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And Nineveh is like a pool of water:</b> It was full from waters of old — wealth — and her people flee and say to one another: Stand, do not flee." "<b>And there is no turning:</b> that turned his face; therefore the words of the prophet despised silver to the Chaldeans."], :book :nahum, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nahum -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nachum"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:35.814105528Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}